Ruby オブジェクトから YAML の AST を構築するためのクラスです。

### 例

```ruby
builder = Psych::Visitors::YAMLTree.new
builder << { :foo => 'bar' }
builder << ["baz", "bazbaz"]
p builder.tree # => #<Psych::Nodes::Stream ... > A stream containing two documents
puts tree.to_yaml
# =>
# ---
# :foo: bar
# ---
# - baz
# - bazbaz
```
